# Spring Boot discovers custom EnvironmentPostProcessor implementations through
# META-INF/spring.factories, keyed by the SPI interface. Spring Boot 4 introduced
# org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor, which is the interface this
# project implements. (The older org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor
# and its META-INF/spring/*.imports file are the pre-4 registration mechanism and
# are no longer picked up.)
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.example.dataentry.config.DotEnvEnvironmentPostProcessor
